                <pb facs="0877" n="765" xml:id="pg765"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Dawson to
                        the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Consulate</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-10-19"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 19,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Dawson states that he arrived in the afternoon of the 18th and formally
                    visited Provisional President on the 19th; that his reception by the President
                    and cabinet was most cordial.</p>
            </div>
